eared to be drifting toward a predictable conclusion, the 90+5th minute delivered a final spark of excitement. [player1] managed to strike late, finding the goal deep into stoppage time to heighten the tension in the stadium. However, the clock was the enemy of the comeback, and the final whistle blew shortly after, confirming the result of a hard-fought battle."
